The test totals and remaining gaps are listed above. They help us catch regressions, but there is still a lot to check through normal play.

[B][SIZE=4]Still in development[/SIZE][/B]

Next up is more rendering work, reconnects and world hopping, and longer gameplay testing. We are still working toward matching the original client. Feedback is welcome.

